# Data Visualization with ggplot2

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
<jats:p>This half-day seminar offers an in-depth introduction to data visualization with ggplot2, an R language package for creating clear, aesthetic graphical representations of complex data. Participants will acquire skills in advanced graph customization and learn how to use ggplot2 to enrich their analyses, supported by the expertise of SMCS at the Université catholique de Louvain.</jats:p>

